#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:2
msgid "Compose built-in extensions"
msgstr "组合内置扩展"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:4
msgid "Start with the capability you need. Passing an extension list replaces optional defaults, so explicitly include history and tool guidance if you want them. Do not add ``InternalMessageExtension`` or ``SteeringExtension`` yourself; the runtime already provides them."
msgstr "先确定你需要的能力。传入扩展列表会替换可选默认值，所以如果需要历史记录和工具 guidelines，请显式加入。不要自己添加 ``InternalMessageExtension`` 或 ``SteeringExtension``；运行时已经提供了它们。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:9
msgid "Capability map"
msgstr "能力对照表"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:13
msgid "Extension"
msgstr "扩展"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:14
msgid "Use when"
msgstr "适用场景"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:15
msgid "Important constraint"
msgstr "重要限制"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:16
msgid "InMemoryMessageAccumulator"
msgstr "InMemoryMessageAccumulator"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:17
msgid "Retain conversation history inside one process."
msgstr "在单个进程内保留对话历史记录。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:18
msgid "Share the instance to share its memory; not durable."
msgstr "共享实例即可共享它的记忆；不具备持久性。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:19
msgid "SQLiteSessionExtension"
msgstr "SQLiteSessionExtension"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:20
msgid "Restore raw history and compaction checkpoints across restarts."
msgstr "在重启后恢复原始历史记录和压缩检查点。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:21
msgid "Close the owned pool; use one history restorer."
msgstr "关闭自己持有的连接池；只使用一个历史记录恢复器。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:22
msgid "JSONLExtension"
msgstr "JSONLExtension"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:23
msgid "Append one self-contained audit record for each Agent turn."
msgstr "为每个 Agent 轮次追加一条自包含的审计记录。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:24
msgid "One session owns one file; earlier turns are not repeated."
msgstr "一个会话对应一个文件；更早的轮次不会被重复写入。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:25
msgid "ToolGuidelinesExtension"
msgstr "ToolGuidelinesExtension"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:26
msgid "Include tool snippets and guidelines in model instructions, or in each tool's description."
msgstr "把 tool snippets 和 guidelines 加入模型指令，或加入每个工具的描述。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:27
msgid "Include explicitly when supplying a custom extension list; ``placement`` chooses where the guidance goes."
msgstr "提供自定义扩展列表时需显式加入；``placement`` 决定这些指引放在哪里。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:28
msgid "AgentsMdExtension"
msgstr "AgentsMdExtension"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:29
msgid "Load working-directory AGENTS.md files into model instructions."
msgstr "把工作目录中的 AGENTS.md 文件加载进模型指令。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:30
msgid "Reads parent directories too; treat files as external input, not authorization."
msgstr "也会读取父目录；请把这些文件当作外部输入，而不是授权。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:31
msgid "FileSystemExtension"
msgstr "FileSystemExtension"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:32
msgid "Read/search or edit files through relative or absolute paths."
msgstr "通过相对或绝对路径读取、搜索或编辑文件。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:33
msgid "Injects the current directory; read_only limits tools, not OS permissions."
msgstr "注入当前目录；read_only 限制的是工具，而不是操作系统的权限。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:34
msgid "CodingExtension"
msgstr "CodingExtension"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:35
msgid "Add writable filesystem tools and shell execution."
msgstr "添加可写的文件系统工具和 shell 执行能力。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:36
msgid "Injects the directory used by relative paths and shell execution."
msgstr "注入相对路径和 shell 执行所使用的目录。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:37
msgid "ReadFileExtension, EditExtension, and the other single-tool extensions"
msgstr "ReadFileExtension、EditExtension 以及其他单工具扩展"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:38
msgid "Offer one built-in tool on its own: read_file, read (text or image), view_image, glob, grep, write_file, edit, delete_file, or bash."
msgstr "单独提供一个内置工具：read_file、read（文本或图像）、view_image、glob、grep、write_file、edit、delete_file 或 bash。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:39
msgid "One extension, one tool; they inject no directory message. ``ToolExtension`` wraps any tool the same way."
msgstr "一个扩展对应一个工具；它们不会注入目录消息。\\ ``ToolExtension`` 可以用同样的方式封装任何工具。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:40
msgid "AskUserExtension"
msgstr "AskUserExtension"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:41
msgid "Let the model ask the UI a question and wait."
msgstr "让模型向 UI 提问并等待回答。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:42
msgid "Route replies with session ID and tool-call ID."
msgstr "用会话 ID 和工具调用 ID 路由回复。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:43
msgid "PlanModeExtension"
msgstr "PlanModeExtension"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:44
msgid "Model-selected planning entry/exit with user approval events."
msgstr "由模型选择进入或退出规划模式，并发出用户审批事件。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:45
msgid "UI must implement its external-response protocol."
msgstr "UI 必须实现它的外部响应协议。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:46
msgid "TodoWriteExtension"
msgstr "TodoWriteExtension"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:47
msgid "Track ordered tasks within the current request."
msgstr "在当前请求内跟踪有序任务。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:48
msgid "Only one in_progress item; lists are cleared at request end."
msgstr "只允许一个 in_progress 条目；列表在请求结束时清空。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:49
msgid "CompactionExtension"
msgstr "CompactionExtension"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:50
msgid "Summarize older complete turns before a model step."
msgstr "在一次模型步骤之前，对更早的完整轮次做摘要。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:51
msgid "Token estimates and model context limits must be configured appropriately."
msgstr "token 估算和模型上下文限制必须配置得当。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:52
msgid "GoalExtension"
msgstr "GoalExtension"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:53
msgid "Continue externally selected Goal Mode work after private evaluation."
msgstr "在内部评估之后继续执行外部选定的目标模式工作。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:54
msgid "UI arms one exact session/request before starting it; selection is one-shot."
msgstr "UI 必须在开始之前为某一个确切的会话/请求做好准备；这种选择只有一次机会。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:55
msgid "SubAgentExtension"
msgstr "SubAgentExtension"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:56
msgid "Delegate to configured child profiles."
msgstr "委托给已配置的子智能体配置。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:57
msgid "Models, tools, and persistence live in each definition."
msgstr "模型、工具和持久化都包含在各自的定义中。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:58
msgid "AsyncSubAgentExtension"
msgstr "AsyncSubAgentExtension"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:59
msgid "Run child profiles in the background and manage them with start, list, status, output, and cancel tools."
msgstr "在后台运行子智能体配置，并通过启动、列表、状态、输出和取消这几个工具来管理它们。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:60
msgid "Tasks live in memory and need the event loop to keep running; call ``close()`` on shutdown."
msgstr "任务保存在内存中，需要事件循环持续运行；关闭时请调用 ``close()``\\ 。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:61
msgid "SkillExtension"
msgstr "SkillExtension"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:62
msgid "Discover skill descriptions and lazily load complete instructions."
msgstr "发现技能描述，并按需懒加载完整指令。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:63
msgid "Treat skill files as external input, not authorization."
msgstr "把技能文件当作外部输入，而不是授权。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:64
msgid "ToolSearchExtension"
msgstr "ToolSearchExtension"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:65
msgid "Search for optional tools instead of sending every definition up front, and list what can be found."
msgstr "搜索可选工具，而不是一开始就发送所有定义，并列出可以找到的工具。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:66
msgid "Requires the Responses or Anthropic Messages protocol; see :doc:`../learn/on-demand`."
msgstr "需要 Responses 或 Anthropic Messages 协议；参见 :doc:`../learn/on-demand`\\ 。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:67
msgid "JITHarnessExtension"
msgstr "JITHarnessExtension"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:68
msgid "Let a model create, compose, update, unload, and reload Python tools."
msgstr "让模型创建、组合、更新、卸载和重新加载 Python 工具。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:69
msgid "Trusted code, not a sandbox; deferred inspection tools keep context small; see :doc:`../learn/jit-harness`."
msgstr "属于受信任的代码，而不是沙箱；延迟加载的检查工具能让上下文保持较小；参见\\ :doc:`../learn/jit-harness`\\ 。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:70
msgid "McpExtension"
msgstr "McpExtension"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:71
msgid "Register remote or subprocess MCP tools."
msgstr "注册远程或子进程 MCP 工具。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:72
msgid "Trust and resource ownership remain application responsibilities."
msgstr "信任与资源归属仍然由应用负责。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:73
msgid "Provider ServerToolExtension variants"
msgstr "各模型提供商的 ServerToolExtension 变体"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:74
msgid "Enable a capability executed by the selected model provider."
msgstr "启用由所选模型提供商执行的能力。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:75
msgid "The tool type and endpoint protocol must be compatible; no local executor runs."
msgstr "工具类型和端点协议必须兼容；不会运行任何本地执行器。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:78
msgid "Try the examples rather than enabling everything"
msgstr "试用示例，而不是启用全部扩展"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:80
msgid "Start with :doc:`../examples/streaming-tools` for tools, :doc:`../examples/sessions` for durability, :doc:`../examples/approval` for user interaction, and :doc:`../examples/compaction` for context management. The :doc:`subagent <../examples/subagent>` and :doc:`goal <../examples/goal>` examples show two distinct delegation patterns."
msgstr "工具方面可以从\\ :doc:`../examples/streaming-tools`\\ 开始，持久性看\\ :doc:`../examples/sessions`，用户交互看\\ :doc:`../examples/approval`，上下文管理看\\ :doc:`../examples/compaction`\\ 。\\ :doc:`子智能体 <../examples/subagent>`\\ 和\\ :doc:`目标 <../examples/goal>`\\ 两个示例展示了两种不同的委派方式。"

#: ../../extending/built-ins.rst:86
msgid "For complete setup guides, see :doc:`../learn/project-instructions` for AGENTS.md, :doc:`../learn/on-demand` for skills and deferred tools, and :doc:`../learn/mcp` for remote tool servers. Browse :doc:`../_generated/group-extensions` for exact configuration options and event payloads."
msgstr "完整的配置指南：AGENTS.md 参见\\ :doc:`../learn/project-instructions`，技能和延迟加载的工具参见\\ :doc:`../learn/on-demand`，远程工具服务器参见\\ :doc:`../learn/mcp`\\ 。想了解确切的配置选项和事件载荷，请浏览\\ :doc:`../_generated/group-extensions`\\ 。"

